    15	%   role alone - never 0.5." A made-up probability is worse than none, because
    16	%   whatever reads it will trust it. So this returns NaN, which cannot be summed,
    17	%   averaged or compared by accident. Safety never depends on it: the trunk must
    18	%   hold under BOTH futures regardless of how they are weighted. The weight only
